OL,3,GNEWSAHospital gets #8m to resolve fire
OL,4,Arisks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has been given #8m in
OL,7,Fgovernment funding to tackle fire
OL,8,Fsafety risks after inspections said
OL,9,Fwork was required on escape routes.
OL,11,FThe Torbay and South Devon NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust was ordered make
OL,13,Flevels four to eight of Torbay
OL,14,FHospital's tower block safer after
OL,15,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,16,FService (DSFRS) inspected it in July.
OL,18,FThe fire service raised concerns over
OL,19,Fwhether people could escape and issued
OL,20,Fan enforcement notice giving the trust
OL,21,Funtil 8 November to take action.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
