OL,3,GNEWSAHospital gets #8m to resolve fire
OL,4,Arisks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said it was developing plans
OL,7,Fto "improve fire compartmentation", the
OL,8,Ffire service had extended the deadline
OL,9,Fto temporarily relocate patients until
OL,10,F18 December, and no services were
OL,11,Fexpected to close.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
